", "closed_by": null, "comments": [{"author": "person-43cbd26d", "body": "<!-- Answer -->
There is a known issue related to the nil pointer dereference panic in the `cellToCell` function of the `virt-handler` during VMI reconciliation in KubeVirt 1.5.0 on Kubernetes 1.28. This is caused by a bug in KubeVirt 1.4.0/1.5.0-rc.2. A fix has been submitted via a pull request and should be available in a future release. As a temporary workaround, using an earlier version of KubeVirt, such as 1.2.1 or 1.3.1, is recommended as they do not have this issue <sup>[[1]](https://github.com/kubevirt/kubevirt/issues/14210)</sup>.


